sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant SPA as Angular SPA
  participant API as TransactionController
  participant S as TransactionService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant D as OutboxDispatcher
  participant P as TransactionProcessor
  participant L as LedgerService

  U->>SPA: transfer 200.00 from A to B
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/transactions<br/>Idempotency-Key: K, Bearer JWT
  API->>S: submit(request, K, user)
  S->>DB: SELECT idempotency (principal, K)
  Note over S,DB: miss, so create (one DB transaction)
  S->>DB: INSERT transaction RECEIVED, idempotency(K) UNIQUE
  S->>S: AccessPolicy + TransactionValidator (advisory)
  S->>DB: UPDATE VALIDATED, INSERT outbox TRANSACTION_VALIDATED, INSERT audit
  DB-->>S: COMMIT
  S-->>API: 202 Accepted (status VALIDATED)
  API-->>SPA: 202 + Location
  Note over D,P: asynchronous, at-least-once
  D->>DB: lease outbox event (attempts+1, optimistic @Version)
  D->>P: process(transactionId)
  P->>DB: BEGIN
  P->>DB: UPDATE status PROCESSING
  P->>L: applyTransfer(tx)
  L->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE lower account id
  L->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE higher account id
  L->>L: check ACTIVE, funds (authoritative)
  L->>DB: UPDATE A debit, UPDATE B credit, INSERT 2 ledger entries
  P->>DB: UPDATE status COMPLETED, INSERT attempt + audit
  DB-->>P: COMMIT (debit and credit are atomic)
  D->>DB: mark outbox DISPATCHED
  SPA->>API: GET /transactions/{id}
  API-->>SPA: status COMPLETED
